<div class="page-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECOGNISE REAL EFFORT</span><h1>Make progress feel rewarding.</h1><p>Clear eligibility, consistent rules and an auditable record of every point.</p></div><a href="<?= e(route_url('/admin/content/achievements')) ?>" class="btn btn-secondary btn-small"><?= icon('award',15) ?> Manage achievements</a></div><div class="two-column"><div class="stack"><section class="card form-card"><h2 class="form-section-title">A little recognition for a real action.</h2><p class="form-section-description">These values apply to future eligible completions. The client never chooses a reward amount. Each activity can award once per learner.</p><form action="<?= e(route_url('/api/admin/rewards')) ?>" method="post" data-api><?= csrfField() ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Qualifying action</th><th>XP</th><th>Enabled</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($rules as $r): ?><tr><td><strong><?= e(match($r['kind']){'lesson'=>'Complete a lesson','quiz'=>'First passing quiz result','assignment'=>'Accepted assignment',default=>ucfirst($r['kind'])}) ?></strong></td><td><input class="input compact-input" name="rules[<?= e($r['kind']) ?>][xp]" type="number" value="<?= (int)$r['xp'] ?>" min="0" max="10000" aria-label="<?= e($r['kind']) ?> XP" required></td><td><input class="switch" name="rules[<?= e($r['kind']) ?>][enabled]" type="checkbox" value="1" <?= $r['enabled']?'checked':'' ?> aria-label="Enable <?= e($r['kind']) ?> XP"></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">Save XP rules <?= icon('check',16) ?></button></div></form></section><section class="card form-card"><h2 class="form-section-title">Make room for real life.</h2><p class="form-section-description">Streak protection covers one eligible missed yesterday, following a qualifying or protected day. Milestones are lifetime awards in this version.</p><form action="<?= e(route_url('/api/admin/settings')) ?>" method="post" data-api><?= csrfField() ?><div class="form-grid"><?php foreach(['streak_protection_enabled'=>['Enable streak protection',0,1],'streak_protection_max'=>['Maximum protections held',0,10],'streak_protection_monthly_limit'=>['Uses per calendar month',0,10],'streak_protection_purchase'=>['Allow virtual-coin purchases',0,1],'streak_protection_cost'=>['Virtual coins per protection',1,10000]] as $key=>[$label,$min,$max]): ?><div class="field"><label for="<?= $key ?>"><?= $label ?></label><?php if($max===1): ?><select id="<?= $key ?>" name="<?= $key ?>"><option value="0" <?= !(int)setting($key,0)?'selected':'' ?>>Disabled</option><option value="1" <?= (int)setting($key,0)?'selected':'' ?>>Enabled</option></select><?php else: ?><input id="<?= $key ?>" name="<?= $key ?>" type="number" min="<?= $min ?>" max="<?= $max ?>" value="<?= (int)setting($key,$min) ?>" required><?php endif; ?></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">Save protection rules</button></div></form></section><section class="card form-card"><h2 class="form-section-title">Lives should encourage, not exclude.</h2><p class="form-section-description">Optional quiz lives apply only to quizzes that opt in. Lessons stay accessible. Setting zero attempt limits on a quiz allows unlimited attempts when lives are disabled.</p><form action="<?= e(route_url('/api/admin/settings')) ?>" method="post" data-api><?= csrfField() ?><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="lives-enabled">Lives system</label><select id="lives-enabled" name="lives_enabled"><option value="0" <?= !(int)setting('lives_enabled',0)?'selected':'' ?>>Disabled · unlimited lives</option><option value="1" <?= (int)setting('lives_enabled',0)?'selected':'' ?>>Enabled on selected quizzes</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="lives-max">Maximum lives</label><input id="lives-max" name="lives_max" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="<?= (int)setting('lives_max',5) ?>" required></div><div class="field"><label for="recovery">Minutes per recovered life</label><input id="recovery" name="lives_recovery_minutes" type="number" min="1" max="1440" value="<?= (int)setting('lives_recovery_minutes',60) ?>" required></div><div class="field"><label for="loss-mode">What consumes a life?</label><select id="loss-mode" name="lives_loss_mode"><option value="attempt" <?= setting('lives_loss_mode','attempt')==='attempt'?'selected':'' ?>>One per attempt with a mistake</option><option value="question" <?= setting('lives_loss_mode','attempt')==='question'?'selected':'' ?>>One per incorrect objective question</option></select></div></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">Save lives rules</button></div></form></section></div><aside class="stack"><section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><h2>A little further up the path.</h2><a href="<?= e(route_url('/admin/content/levels')) ?>" class="text-link">Edit levels <?= icon('pen',13) ?></a></div><?php foreach($levels as $l): ?><div class="key-value"><span>Level <?= (int)$l['level'] ?> · <?= e($l['title']) ?></span><strong><?= number($l['minimum_xp']) ?> XP</strong></div><?php endforeach; ?></section><section class="card card-pad"><div class="card-header"><h2>Milestones with meaning.</h2></div><div class="mini-list"><?php foreach($achievements as $a): ?><a class="mini-list-item" href="<?= e(route_url('/admin/content/achievements/' . ((int)$a['id']) . '/edit')) ?>"><span class="icon-tile orange"><?= icon($a['icon'],18) ?></span><div><strong><?= e($a['title']) ?></strong><small><?= (int)$a['threshold_value'] ?> <?= e($a['metric']) ?> · +<?= (int)$a['xp_reward'] ?> XP<?= $a['protection_reward']?' · +'.(int)$a['protection_reward'].' protection':'' ?></small></div><?= icon('chevron',14) ?></a><?php endforeach; ?></div></section><div class="notice info"><?= icon('shield',18) ?><p>Rule changes are audited. Existing XP and coin transactions are not silently rewritten. No virtual reward has a promised cash value.</p></div></aside></div>
